function removeEndSpaces
	//put the num of chars of currentUserAnswer into tTotalChars

	//put the last word of currentUserAnswer into tLastWord
	//put the length of tLastWord into tLength

	//put offset(tLastWord,currentUserAnswer) into tOffset
	//put tLength + tOffset into tLastWordEnd
	//delete char tLastWordEnd to tTotalChars of currentUserAnswer

	 local tAnswer, tNewAnswer, tCurrentLine

	put currentUserAnswer into tAnswer

	 repeat for each line xLine in tAnswer
		 put empty into tCurrentLine

		 repeat for each word xWord in xLine
			 put xWord & space after tCurrentLine
		 end repeat
		 delete char -1 of tCurrentLine

		 put tCurrentLine & lf after tNewAnswer
	 end repeat
	 delete char -1 of tNewAnswer

	put tNewAnswer into currentUserAnswer
end removeEndSpaces
